#: src/menus/colors/tone-mapping.xml:6(title)
msgid "The <quote>Tone Mapping</quote> Submenu"
msgstr "O submenu <quote>Mapeamento de Tons</quote>"

#: src/menus/colors/tone-mapping.xml:10(secondary)
msgid "Tone Mapping"
msgstr "Mapeamento de Tons"

#: src/menus/colors/tone-mapping.xml:13(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guimenuitem>Tone Mapping</guimenuitem> submenu contains operations that"
#| " allow you to use tone maping to adjust the colors of images. Most of the "
#| "filters provide ways to adjust High Dynamic Range images (HDR) to "
#| "presentation using a low dynamic range."
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Tone Mapping</guimenuitem> submenu contains operations that"
" allow you to use tone mapping to adjust the colors of images. Most of the "
"filters provide ways to adjust High Dynamic Range images (HDR) to "
"presentation using a low dynamic range."
msgstr ""
"O submenu <guimenuitem>Mapeamento de Tons</guimenuitem> contém operações que"
" lhe permitem usar mapeamento de tons para ajustar as cores de imagens. A "
"maioria dos filtros providencia formas de ajustar imagens de Alto Intervalo "
"Dinâmico (HDR) para apresentação usando baixo intervalo dinâmico."

