#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:9(title)
msgid "Shadows-Highlights"
msgstr "Sombras-Tons Claros"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:13(secondary)
#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:16(primary)
msgid "Shadows and Highlights"
msgstr "Sombras e Tons Claros"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:19(para)
msgid ""
"This filter allows adjusting shadows and highlights in the image separately."
" The implementation closely follow its counterpart in the Darktable "
"photography software <ulink "
"url=\"https://docs.darktable.org/usermanual/development/en/module-"
"reference/processing-modules/shadows-and-highlights/\">Shadows and "
"Highlights</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Este filtro permite o ajuste de sombras e tons claros na imagem "
"separadamente. A implementação é bem próxima de sua contraparte no programa "
"de fotografia Darktable <ulink "
"url=\"https://docs.darktable.org/usermanual/development/en/module-"
"reference/processing-modules/shadows-and-highlights/\">Sombras e Tons "
"Claros</ulink>."

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:28(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can access this command from the image menubar through "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Colors</guimenu><guimenuitem>Shadows-"
#| "Highlights…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Colors</guimenu><guimenuitem>Shadows-"
"Highlights…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Você pode acessar o comando a partir da barra de menu da imagem em "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Cores</guimenu><guimenuitem>Sombras-Tons "
"Claros...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:40(title)
msgid "Shadows-Highlights Options"
msgstr "Opções de Sombras-Tons Claros"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:51(term)
#: src/menus/colors/rgb-clip.xml:48(term)
#: src/menus/colors/introduction.xml:256(term)
#: src/menus/colors/gegl-local-threshold.xml:40(term)
#: src/menus/colors/dither.xml:47(term)
msgid "Input Type"
msgstr "Tipo de Entrada"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:52(term)
#: src/menus/colors/rgb-clip.xml:49(term)
#: src/menus/colors/introduction.xml:297(term)
#: src/menus/colors/gegl-local-threshold.xml:41(term)
#: src/menus/colors/dither.xml:48(term)
msgid "Clipping"
msgstr "Corte"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:64(term)
#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:68(term)
msgid "Shadows"
msgstr "Sombras"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:70(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<guilabel>Shadows</guilabel>: This slider controls the effect on shadows; "
#| "positive values lighten shadows while negative values darken them."
msgid ""
"This slider controls the effect on shadows; positive values lighten shadows "
"while negative values darken them."
msgstr ""
"Este controle deslizante controla o efeito sobre as sombras; valores "
"positivos clareiam as sombras, enquanto valores negativos as escurecem."

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:77(term)
msgid "Shadows color adjustment"
msgstr "Ajuste de cor das sombras"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:79(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<guilabel>Shadows color adjustment</guilabel>: This slider controls the "
#| "color saturation adjustment made to shadows; high values cause saturation "
#| "enhancements on lightened shadows; low values cause desaturation on "
#| "lightened shadows. It is normally safe to leave this at its default of 100%."
#| " This gives a natural saturation boost on shadows&mdash;similar to the one "
#| "you would also expect in nature if shadows received more light."
msgid ""
"This slider controls the color saturation adjustment made to shadows; high "
"values cause saturation enhancements on lightened shadows; low values cause "
"desaturation on lightened shadows. It is normally safe to leave this at its "
"default of 100%. This gives a natural saturation boost on "
"shadows&mdash;similar to the one you would also expect in nature if shadows "
"received more light."
msgstr ""
"Este controle deslizante controla o ajuste de saturação de cor feito nas "
"sombras; valores altos causam aumento de saturação nas sombras clareadas; "
"valores baixos causam dessaturação nas sombras clareadas. Normalmente é "
"seguro deixar isto no padrão de 100%. Isso dá um realce natural de saturação"
" nas sombras&mdash;semelhante ao que você esperaria na natureza se as "
"sombras recebessem mais luz."

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:96(term)
#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:100(term)
#| msgid "Shadows-Highlights"
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Realces"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:102(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<guilabel>Highlights</guilabel>: This slider controls the effect on "
#| "highlights; negative values darken highlights while positive values lighten "
#| "them."
msgid ""
"This slider controls the effect on highlights; negative values darken "
"highlights while positive values lighten them."
msgstr ""
"Este controle deslizante controla o efeito sobre os realces; valores "
"negativos escurecem os realces, enquanto valores positivos os clareiam."

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:109(term)
msgid "Highlights color adjustment"
msgstr "Ajuste de cor dos realces"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:111(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<guilabel>Highlights color adjustment</guilabel>: This slider controls the "
#| "color saturation adjustment made to highlights; high values cause saturation"
#| " enhancements on darkened highlights; low values cause desaturation on "
#| "darkened highlights. Often highlights do not contain enough color "
#| "information to give convincing colors when darkened. You might need to play "
#| "a bit with this parameter in order to find the best fitting value depending "
#| "on your specific image; but be aware that sometimes results still might not "
#| "be fully satisfying."
msgid ""
"This slider controls the color saturation adjustment made to highlights; "
"high values cause saturation enhancements on darkened highlights; low values"
" cause desaturation on darkened highlights. Often highlights do not contain "
"enough color information to give convincing colors when darkened. You might "
"need to play a bit with this parameter in order to find the best fitting "
"value depending on your specific image; but be aware that sometimes results "
"still might not be fully satisfying."
msgstr ""
"Este controle deslizante controla o ajuste de saturação de cor feito nos "
"realces; valores altos causam aumento de saturação nos realces escurecidos; "
"valores baixos causam dessaturação nos realces escurecidos. Muitas vezes os "
"realces não contêm informação de cor suficiente para dar cores convincentes "
"quando escurecidos. Talvez você precise ajustar um pouco este parâmetro para"
" encontrar o valor mais adequado à sua imagem específica; mas esteja ciente "
"de que às vezes os resultados ainda podem não ser totalmente satisfatórios."

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:129(term)
msgid "Common"
msgstr "Comum"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:131(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Common</emphasis>: options common to shadows and "
#| "highlights:"
msgid "These options are common for shadows and highlights."
msgstr "Estas opções são comuns a sombras e realces."

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:134(term)
#| msgid "White point"
msgid "White point adjustment"
msgstr "Ajuste do ponto branco"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:136(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<guilabel>White point adjustment</guilabel>: By default the algorithm of "
#| "this module leaves black point and white point untouched. In some cases an "
#| "image might contain tonal variations beyond the white point, i.e. above a "
#| "luminance value of 100. A negative shift in the white point adjustment "
#| "slider allows to bring these values down into the proper range so that "
#| "further details in the highlights get visible."
msgid ""
"By default the algorithm of this module leaves black point and white point "
"untouched. In some cases an image might contain tonal variations beyond the "
"white point, i.e. above a luminance value of 100. A negative shift in the "
"white point adjustment slider allows to bring these values down into the "
"proper range so that further details in the highlights get visible."
msgstr ""
"Por padrão, o algoritmo deste módulo deixa o ponto preto e o ponto branco "
"intocados. Em alguns casos, uma imagem pode conter variações tonais além do "
"ponto branco, ou seja, acima de um valor de luminância de 100. Um "
"deslocamento negativo no controle deslizante de ajuste do ponto branco "
"permite trazer esses valores para a faixa adequada, de modo que mais "
"detalhes nos realces fiquem visíveis."

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:148(term)
#: src/menus/colors/gegl-local-threshold.xml:51(term)
msgid "Radius"
msgstr "Raio"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:150(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<guilabel>Radius</guilabel>: This slider controls the radius of the involved"
#| " blurring filter. Higher values give softer transitions between shadows and "
#| "highlights but might introduce halos. Lower values reduce the size of halos "
#| "but may lead to an artificial look."
msgid ""
"This slider controls the radius of the involved blurring filter. Higher "
"values give softer transitions between shadows and highlights but might "
"introduce halos. Lower values reduce the size of halos but may lead to an "
"artificial look."
msgstr ""
"Este controle deslizante controla o raio do filtro de desfoque envolvido. "
"Valores mais altos dão transições mais suaves entre sombras e realces, mas "
"podem introduzir halos. Valores menores reduzem o tamanho dos halos, mas "
"podem levar a um aspecto artificial."

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:159(term)
#| msgid "Components"
msgid "Compress"
msgstr "Comprimir"

#: src/menus/colors/shadows-highlights.xml:161(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<guilabel>Compress</guilabel>: This slider controls how strong the effect "
#| "extends to mid-tones; high values reduce the effect to the extreme shadows "
#| "and highlights; low values cause strong adjustments also to mid-tones. You "
#| "normally only need to touch this parameter if you want to limit the effects "
#| "to the extreme shadows and highlights; increase the value in this case. At "
#| "100% this module has no visible effect any longer as only absolute black and"
#| " absolute white are affected."
msgid ""
"This slider controls how strong the effect extends to mid-tones; high values"
" reduce the effect to the extreme shadows and highlights; low values cause "
"strong adjustments also to mid-tones. You normally only need to touch this "
"parameter if you want to limit the effects to the extreme shadows and "
"highlights; increase the value in this case. At 100% this module has no "
"visible effect any longer as only absolute black and absolute white are "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"Este controle deslizante controla a força com que o efeito se estende aos "
"meios-tons; valores altos reduzem o efeito às sombras e realces extremos; "
"valores baixos causam ajustes fortes também nos meios-tons. Normalmente você"
" só precisa mexer neste parâmetro se quiser limitar os efeitos às sombras e "
"realces extremos; nesse caso, aumente o valor. Em 100%, este módulo não tem "
"mais efeito visível, pois apenas o preto absoluto e o branco absoluto são "
"afetados."

